WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.180
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:07.690
What's SOL Technologies planning 
to do by acquiring an Ignis?

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.600
This is SOL Technologies’ databank.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.500
Are they serious?

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:22.540
Kengo Dojun aka Blood Shepherd.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.040
An AI-hating bounty hunter.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.510
He'll be trouble if he becomes our enemy.

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:31.520
It’s pointless to hide things from me.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:35.450
Using the data you acquired from the Ignis...

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:41.090
...that plan says you plan to create a new 
AI with free will: a high-performance Ignis.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.080
I’ll think about what I’ll do.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:49.730
You have a huge hole in your 
heart after losing your father.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:53.330
You know my identity?

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.760
Why at count two?

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:01.580
You’ll do anything to accomplish your goal.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:05.040
That’s why I chose you.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.380
Interesting.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:12.120
I'm now curious to test the 
Knights of Hanoi's power.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:16.420
Borreload Savage Dragon attacks you directly!

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.670
So this is the power of the Hanoi.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.680
The rebel Ignis are powerful.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:35.360
In your current state, you can't 
win against their Link Spells.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:38.150
Use this duel as a lesson.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:41.280
I don’t need your advice!

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.290
I'll pay you back!

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:50.020
His savage soul is what I expected.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:12.360
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:19.150
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:26.470
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:33.040
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:39.790
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:47.020
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:53.730
I want to share your pain

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.600
Revolver doesn't slip up.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.690
He erased all traces of the duel.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:50.900
Revolver and Blood Shepherd are both 
excellent duelists and hackers.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:56.080
If they team up, it won’t be good for us.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:57.640
Right?

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:02.190
Oh yeah.  You can’t answer.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:07.940
Considering the risk, 
I'll act now while I can.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.800
Damn.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:17.870
Damn!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:25.420
Lightning...

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.800
How dare those humans!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.420
You look horrible.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:33.360
What!

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.560
Nothing "what" about it.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.600
I just said what I saw.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:41.330
Don’t look at me like I’m 
a bug that can’t be fixed!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.330
Oh.  So you do understand.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:49.300
A program destroyed by that virus 
can’t be completely fixed.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:53.960
Damn!  I can’t forgive those 
humans for doing this to me!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.550
How’s the fight against them going?

00:04:56.550 --> 00:05:01.470
SOL’s bounty hunter captured 
and destroyed Earth.

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:05.320
Oh?  That happened?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:11.280
He'd never have joined us, so it 
saved us the trouble of ending him.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:14.760
Aqua fled and joined Playmaker’s side.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.640
So she joined them, like I expected.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:23.040
If I only was restored, I could crushed her!

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.310
Go to the designated location.

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.850
Bohman’s task is almost done.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.620
What'll you do?

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.620
I still have something to do here.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:33.730
Something to do?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:37.340
I’ll make this place a grave.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.820
Where are you?

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.720
Where are you, Jin?

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.970
Well?  Found any leads on Lightning?

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.750
Unfortunately, I haven’t found anything.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:04.960
Me neither.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:05.940
Nor I.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.550
I've found nothing either.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.360
Maybe they already fled.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.520
Don't kid yourself.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:18.000
They’re the type that'll erase 
anything that worries them.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.270
That's what they'll do.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.520
So it’s the quiet before the storm.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.510
LINK VRAINS is huge.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:30.470
We don't have enough people to search.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.750
I can enhance my pets’ programs, 
but it won't be enough.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:38.710
We need more allies.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.160
Allies…

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:56.960
Father…

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:03.450
I always hated you for 
abandoning me and my mother.

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:07.220
However…

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.100
Brother…

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.960
You came here?

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.200
You've forgiven our father?

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.600
Wrong.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:27.030
I came here to break up with him.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.030
I see.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:36.060
Brother, something terrible is 
about to happen to LINK VRAINS.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.740
You mean the Ignis’ rebellion?

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.240
You know about it?

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:41.210
Then this won’t take long.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.950
I want you to help us.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.940
I’m a lone wolf bounty hunter.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.320
I won't team up with anyone.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.460
Besides, there’s something new I must do.

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:56.320
Something you must do?

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.930
Emma, don’t get involved this time.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:03.170
This opponent is too dangerous.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.170
Brother…

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:12.470
Ignis, I promise to track you down!

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:19.740
It’s pointless to hide, Ignis!

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.960
He's on the move.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:31.280
Someone is scanning for the Ignis.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:34.240
It’s a high-quality program.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:38.190
Our surveillance program 
has identified the person.

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:42.430
It's Blood Shepherd.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:47.420
Instead of joining us, he 
decided to fight on his own.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:51.880
What's this signal?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:55.130
Through me you pass into the sparkle of woe.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:09:00.030
Through me you pass into 
anguishing brilliance.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:03.850
Through me among the light lost for aye.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:09.550
All hope abandon ye who enter here.

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:14.190
So he’s challenging me?  Fine!

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:23.200
Yusak-  Playmaker!  There’s a signal.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.580
You’re nearby, so check it out.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.730
Okay.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.620
Who are you?

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:42.040
Blood Shepherd.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:46.510
What do you see beyond despair?

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.830
Welcome to my palace.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.560
I'm the Light Ignis.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:58.190
You’re the one who declared war on humans?

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.320
That’s right.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.040
You fool.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:06.620
AIs are less perfect than us, 
so you can’t conquer humanity.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.320
Are you sure?

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:12.600
I think humans are far less perfect than us.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:18.440
You have limited life spans, and 
you don’t even try to avoid it.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:21.440
Humans are already over.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.800
Be quiet!

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.660
An AI can't lecture me!

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.140
You think humans are superior.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:33.610
So it’s pointless talking to you.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.600
But I want you to remember this.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:42.010
The idea of human supremacy won’t accept 
that others can be superior to you.

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:45.080
That is the root of all evil.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.290
I’ve had enough of your speeches!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.550
Let’s duel, Light Ignis!

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:56.520
Of course.  But when you duel me, 
you’ll have to bet everything.

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.120
Everything?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.450
That’s right.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:03.690
To say it simply, you’re 
betting your existence.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.700
The loser will have all their data taken.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:10.440
Including your consciousness data, like him.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:12.910
And if I win?

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:17.150
You can treat me however you like.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:20.680
Don’t forget you said that.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:24.350
Fine!  I’m a bounty hunter!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:27.530
In this job, I’ve always 
had to risk everything!

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:31.320
Wonderful!  What a moving response.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:32.910
Duel!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.400
Playmaker, learn something?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.350
There’s something up ahead.

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:46.750
According to Kusanagi’s map, 
it should be around here.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.830
Hey, what’s that?

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:56.160
Playmaker, it leads to a different area.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.030
Yeah, I sense it.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.840
What’s ahead is…

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:01.130
It's definitely...

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.860
Lightning.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.590
We finally found him.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:07.600
It doesn’t seem to be a trap.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:11.150
We finally found a lead, so 
we can’t let it slip us by!

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.080
Let’s go!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:15.610
You're brave, Blue Maiden!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:19.690
He will atone for destroying Cyberse World!

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:20.700
Let’s go!

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:21.690
Yeah!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:30.720
Playmaker's team found the Light Ignis.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.720
Seems so.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:35.040
You're going?

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:39.200
It's my responsibility to see this duel.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.950
I'll accompany you.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.520
Into the VRAINS!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.860
Where are we?

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:53.890
A palace?

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:57.100
That’s…

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.900
Blood Shepherd!

00:12:58.900 --> 00:12:59.840
What?

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.830
Playmaker!  The one over there is…

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:05.610
Jin!

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:09.880
Oh yeah.  If he’s battling Lightning…

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:13.080
He’s battling Kusanagi’s brother!

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:17.100
Blood Shepherd!  Why are you here?

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:20.140
What’s going on?

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:22.420
I have no business with you!

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:25.400
Don’t interfere.  This is my duel!

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:29.280
It’s not like we have 
business with you either!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:31.370
Why are you dueling?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.040
I invited him.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:39.160
I intended to invite you as spectators too.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:42.700
Why did you invite Blood Shepherd?

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:49.970
On my side in this fight, I 
only have Bohman and Windy.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:54.460
But there are many people 
who want to kill us.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.450
You have the numbers advantage.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:00.200
Well, that’s true.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:05.620
If you team with Blood Shepherd, 
it'll make things more difficult.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:11.880
So before the real fight, I decided 
to chop the unnecessary weeds.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.850
Unnecessary?

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.060
That’s right.

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:23.170
To put it simply, I'll defeat our 
enemies, starting with the weakest.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:28.090
Light Ignis, I will end you!

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.880
I’ll go first!

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:38.860
I summon Drone XL from my hand!

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:45.800
I set Drone XL in the Link Marker!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:53.890
Deploy!  Link 1 BattleDrone Sergeant!

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:58.000
Drone XL’s effect!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:05.960
When it’s used to Link Summon and sent to 
the graveyard, I Special Summon a Drone Token!

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:15.570
When there’s a Drone on my field, I can 
Special Summon Scud Drone from my hand!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:21.740
I set Sergeant and Scud 
Drone in the Link Markers!

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.440
Link Summon!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.840
Deploy!  Link 2 Battledrone Warrant!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:33.690
Come out again!  The circuit 
that leads to victory!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:38.620
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Drones!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.210
Link Summon!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:45.240
Deploy!  Link 3 Battledrone General!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.880
His ace monster already appeared.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:54.540
Due to General’s effect, I Special Summon 
a Drone from my graveyard next to its link!

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:57.250
Resurrect, Warrant!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.980
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:03.210
Blood Shepherd…

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.940
In just one turn, he summoned 
the Link 3 General.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.930
Brother…

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:13.800
What type of duel will Lighting do?

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.520
My turn.  I draw.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:24.300
I activate the Field 
Spell, Armatos Colosseum!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.920
What?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.910
This is…

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:55.260
What do you think?  Do you like it?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:04.280
When this card activates, I can add an 
Armatos Legio from my deck to my hand.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:09.490
Blood Shepherd and the Light Ignis.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:12.770
What an interesting matchup.

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:15.850
I gave Blood Shepherd a hint.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:18.960
So he must be prepared for it.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:22.110
But will it work?

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:26.450
I summon Armatos Legio Seeker.

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:29.900
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:33.820
I set Seeker in the Link Marker.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.370
Link Summon!

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:42.800
Appear, Link 1 Armatos Legio Decurion!

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:47.180
The Field Spell, Armatos 
Colosseum’s effect activates.

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:50.850
I send Armatos Legio Gradius 
in my hand to the graveyard...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:56.360
...to Special Summon Seeker from my graveyard 
next to Decurion’s link in defense position.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:01.060
Then I activate Speculata's 
effect from my hand!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:04.650
I send an Armatos Legio in 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:09.040
I Special Summon this 
card in defense position.

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:12.720
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:16.730
The summoning conditions 
are two Armatos Legio!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.020
Link Summon!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:24.930
Appear, Link 2 Armatos Legio Centurion!

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:31.260
The Field Spell, Armatos 
Colosseum’s effect activates!

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:34.730
I send Scutum from my 
hand to the graveyard...

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:38.700
...to Special Summon Speculata 
and Seeker from my graveyard next

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.880
to Centurion’s link in defense position!

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.040
Appear.  The circuit that guides the light.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:49.410
I set Speculata in the Link Marker!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:54.520
Appear, Link 1 Armatos Legio Decurion!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:59.460
I activate the Link Spell, Judgment Arrows.

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:06.460
This card can only be activated next to a 
Link Monster’s link in the Spell & Trap Zone.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:14.720
When a Link Monster linked to this card 
battles, its ATK double during damage calculation.

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:20.940
But when this card leaves the field, all 
monsters next to its links are destroyed.

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:23.940
So there's Judgment Arrows.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:26.420
It's the card Revolver talked about!

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:29.650
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:33.390
The summoning conditions 
are two Armatos Legio.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:36.800
Link Summon!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:41.600
Appear, Link 2 Armatos Legio Centurion!

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:45.080
The Light Ignis used that card.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.840
As expected.

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:50.070
Now what will Blood Shepherd do?

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.310
Battle!

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:55.050
Centurion attacks Warrant.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.910
Abandon all hope.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:05.220
Lightning has Decurion with 1000 
ATK and Centurion with 1700 ATK!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:09.520
And due to Judgment Arrows’ 
effect, their ATK are doubled!

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:15.460
If all attacks get through, Blood 
Shepherd will run out of LP.

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.700
What an abrupt ending.

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:21.510
Not yet!  I’ve figured out your attack!

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:24.890
I activate the Continuous Trap, Snatch Drone!

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:30.880
A card in your Spell & Trap 
Zone is negated and destroyed!

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:33.790
I destroy Judgment Arrows!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:34.620
What?

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:42.190
He destroyed the Link Spell.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:48.430
When Judgment Arrows leaves the field, all 
monsters next to its links are destroyed.

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:53.700
Now all your monsters will be destroyed.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:57.160
Not bad.  But that won’t happen.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:58.140
What?

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:00.840
Decurion’s effect.

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:05.140
When another effect destroys 
an Armatos Legio...

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:10.000
... I can send it to the graveyard 
to negate the destruction.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:16.160
Centurion attacks Warrant!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.320
Fortis Lux!

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:30.970
I end my turn.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:35.750
Blood Shepherd planned to use 
Judgment Arrows’s effect

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:38.980
to destroy all of Lightning’s monsters.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:40.950
Definitely.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:46.340
When Judgment Arrows activated, 
he didn’t use Snatch Drone.

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:49.420
He waited for Centurion to 
be summoned next to its link.

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:54.400
Not bad.  And Blood Shepherd 
still has General on his field!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.870
Light Ignis…

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:03.060
It’s time for you to abandon all hope!

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:23.930
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.930 --> 00:22:25.370
Even denials are obvious

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:26.500
That There This Whichever

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:28.340
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:30.000
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.570
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:32.740
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:39.780
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:42.850
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:45.990
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:49.060
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:57.630
Let your emotions spill

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:03.770
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:04.170 --> 00:23:09.180
If we're together

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:12.580
We can seize it

00:23:36.860 --> 00:23:42.400
Blood Shepherd's perfect strategy 
anticipates all his opponent's moves.

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:50.310
To end his derailed destiny, the mightiest 
air fortress Drone monster launches.

00:23:50.310 --> 00:23:54.520
Victory is near... at least until now.

00:23:54.520 --> 00:23:58.050
You can break past this solid formation?

00:23:58.050 --> 00:24:02.720
